{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/e4ba37f7414f433271ae0f48ac34533f.avif?t=1753778503\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras_big/e4ba37f7414f433271ae0f48ac34533f.avif?t=1753778503 width=800 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fireside Fables is a<strong> narrative driven 3D platformer</strong>, which follows a group of children telling stories around a campfire. These stories then come to life, and you<strong> play through them as your favourite plushie!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/a4ce8fbc2c84d5f9713ebf301a240851.poster.avif?t=1753778503\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/a4ce8fbc2c84d5f9713ebf301a240851.webm?t=1753778503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/a4ce8fbc2c84d5f9713ebf301a240851.mp4?t=1753778503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be transported across worlds! From a pirate island, to a lush forest, even to outer space - <strong>Anywhere that the children's imaginations can take you!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/601989d6f7dc6cec828eb870ad8b1ed7.avif?t=1753778503\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras_big/601989d6f7dc6cec828eb870ad8b1ed7.avif?t=1753778503 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/80d2bf66097ae0bddd16e76122e61ef3.avif?t=1753778503\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras_big/80d2bf66097ae0bddd16e76122e61ef3.avif?t=1753778503 width=800 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fireside Fables will tell a<strong> heartwarming story</strong> about a group of children, who escape into their imaginations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you start your journey into each world, you will have time to <strong>sit at the campfire with the other children.</strong> You will be able to learn their thoughts, feelings, loves, fears...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/691a52f756d8e021544ca09b8bab2ba8.avif?t=1753778503\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras_big/691a52f756d8e021544ca09b8bab2ba8.avif?t=1753778503 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the course of the game, the underlying narrative will begin to show itself. <strong>There is more to these kids than initially seems</strong>...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/ee5b63111fdc8615e262037fe74bd5a0.avif?t=1753778503\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras_big/ee5b63111fdc8615e262037fe74bd5a0.avif?t=1753778503 width=800 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>InkForge Studios </strong>is supporting<strong> Great Ormond Street Hospital Charity (GOSH Charity) </strong>by donating<strong> 25% </strong>of the game\u2019s<strong> Steam revenue!</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >InkForge Studios Creative Director, <strong>Thomas Hunt</strong>, is a outpatient at GOSH. From the <strong>age of just 2 weeks old</strong>, Tom had to undergo an operation and has been a <strong>patient there ever since</strong>. This was what initially fueled our desire to develop our previous title, 'I'll be Brave, Tomorrow' in partnership with GOSH, and the same is true for 'Fireside Fables'!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365560?t=1753778503","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365560?t=1753778503","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/39d10cb275c7fea1b55ae83833fd63f0d6b0ce49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753778503","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/39d10cb275c7fea1b55ae83833fd63f0d6b0ce49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753778503","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>London Games Festival</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/9d14369511d9011655f5c533bdd09751.avif?t=1753778503\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras_big/9d14369511d9011655f5c533bdd09751.avif?t=1753778503 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We have been selected to take part in the London Games Festival 2025! Play a demo of Fireside Fables at New Game Plus\u00a0Thursday 3 April &amp; Friday 4 April, and keep an eye out for the Steam event!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/e4ba37f7414f433271ae0f48ac34533f.avif?t=1753778503\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras_big/e4ba37f7414f433271ae0f48ac34533f.avif?t=1753778503 width=800 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fireside Fables is a<strong> narrative driven 3D platformer</strong>, which follows a group of children telling stories around a campfire. These stories then come to life, and you<strong> play through them as your favourite plushie!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/a4ce8fbc2c84d5f9713ebf301a240851.poster.avif?t=1753778503\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/a4ce8fbc2c84d5f9713ebf301a240851.webm?t=1753778503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/a4ce8fbc2c84d5f9713ebf301a240851.mp4?t=1753778503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be transported across worlds! From a pirate island, to a lush forest, even to outer space - <strong>Anywhere that the children's imaginations can take you!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/601989d6f7dc6cec828eb870ad8b1ed7.avif?t=1753778503\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras_big/601989d6f7dc6cec828eb870ad8b1ed7.avif?t=1753778503 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/80d2bf66097ae0bddd16e76122e61ef3.avif?t=1753778503\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras_big/80d2bf66097ae0bddd16e76122e61ef3.avif?t=1753778503 width=800 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fireside Fables will tell a<strong> heartwarming story</strong> about a group of children, who escape into their imaginations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you start your journey into each world, you will have time to <strong>sit at the campfire with the other children.</strong> You will be able to learn their thoughts, feelings, loves, fears...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/691a52f756d8e021544ca09b8bab2ba8.avif?t=1753778503\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras_big/691a52f756d8e021544ca09b8bab2ba8.avif?t=1753778503 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the course of the game, the underlying narrative will begin to show itself. <strong>There is more to these kids than initially seems</strong>...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras/ee5b63111fdc8615e262037fe74bd5a0.avif?t=1753778503\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/extras_big/ee5b63111fdc8615e262037fe74bd5a0.avif?t=1753778503 width=800 height=155 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>InkForge Studios </strong>is supporting<strong> Great Ormond Street Hospital Charity (GOSH Charity) </strong>by donating<strong> 25% </strong>of the game\u2019s<strong> Steam revenue!</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >InkForge Studios Creative Director, <strong>Thomas Hunt</strong>, is a outpatient at GOSH. From the <strong>age of just 2 weeks old</strong>, Tom had to undergo an operation and has been a <strong>patient there ever since</strong>. This was what initially fueled our desire to develop our previous title, 'I'll be Brave, Tomorrow' in partnership with GOSH, and the same is true for 'Fireside Fables'!</p></li></ul>","developers":["InkForge Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365560/e2af8aa5c999917e4fa2312754e255dae3c0b2b9/header.jpg?t=1753778503","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3365560/851293/d51056da021f9b08978ab258208aabdb964c8359/1750844311/dash_av1.mpd?t=1741973115","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3365560/851293/d51056da021f9b08978ab258208aabdb964c8359/1750844311/dash_h264.mpd?t=1741973115","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3365560/851293/d51056da021f9b08978ab258208aabdb964c8359/1750844311/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1741973115","id":257114517,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114517/movie480.mp4?t=1741973115","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114517/movie_max.mp4?t=1741973115"},"name":"Kickstarter Trailer (Short)","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257114517/60242f5f3b6411efa5e845945ca77ceb0423a26d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741973115","w